      "notes": "Panel (b) of Fig. 2 (with blending function) \u2014 the only data-plot panel requested. Single black curve traced by color-mask pixel tracking (dark/black pixels for most of the curve, red pixels for the highlighted 'blending function' segment between the MHF point and the point where it rejoins the black film-boiling branch); both colors represent the same continuous physical curve so they were merged into one series. Axes calibrated from log-scale tick label pixel centroids (no vector/text layer for axis ticks was present, figure is a flat raster image). The colored ONB/CHF/MHF markers visible in the legend are single characteristic points lying exactly on this curve, not separate series, so they were not extracted as independent series to avoid fabricating trends from single points. Small pixel gaps under the ONB/CHF/MHF marker circles and around the legend/info-box/annotation text (masked out to avoid contaminating the trace) were bridged by linear interpolation along the traced path."
